  "_fogged_notes": "Standalone grass cross, largest growth stage (age 3) x fullest moisture (m4). This is the master shape for all 20 foggy_grass_age{0-3}_m{0-4}.json files -- the other 19 are this same crossed-quad shape scaled narrower/shorter for younger age or lower moisture. Keep texture var '#0' and render_type cutout. Reshape freely; the 19 size variants get re-derived proportionally at plug-in time. Textures per age are foggy_grass_0..3.png (m0-4 all share one age's texture, only geometry changes across m).",
